                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e5132c0e-a865-30ce-8a3a-04ba18afbcaf",
                        "entry_id": "7045625b-46a8-3cb7-aeeb-c85a24b1280d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "биол., мед. представитель сигнальных химических веществ, выделяемых эндокринными железами непосредственно в кровь и оказывающие сложное и многогранное воздействие на организм в целом либо на определённые органы и ткани-мишени"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf1ac979-7919-45da-baff-8c019f34a23d",
                                "sense_id": "e5132c0e-a865-30ce-8a3a-04ba18afbcaf",
                                "text": "Гормоны щитовидной железы оказывают огромное влияние на рост ребёнка, играют ключевую роль в формировании мозга."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "efb29c0e-043e-4274-8c72-205d19924698",
                        "source_entry_id": "7045625b-46a8-3cb7-aeeb-c85a24b1280d",
                        "source_sense_id": "e5132c0e-a865-30ce-8a3a-04ba18afbcaf",
                        "target_lang_word": "hormone",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hormone",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12a18c5d-1a4e-3ac4-a694-30acff6409ed",
                                        "entry_id": "feb5c607-5c99-3495-a16d-39f0f9d1406d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any substance produced by one tissue and conveyed by the bloodstream to another to effect physiological activity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e18ab215-2ebf-436d-b166-6f19ba9ad9b2",
                                                "sense_id": "12a18c5d-1a4e-3ac4-a694-30acff6409ed",
                                                "text": "Interfemale dominance may be facilitated by female sex hormones as well as adrenal testosterone..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5631d7eb-6d04-4b7e-8402-25188a760810",
                                                "sense_id": "12a18c5d-1a4e-3ac4-a694-30acff6409ed",
                                                "text": "Hormones are the bicycle couriers of the body, delivering chemical messages all around the teeming metropolis that is you."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fdf1d69-191b-4f1d-b732-eb2679533945",
                                                "sense_id": "12a18c5d-1a4e-3ac4-a694-30acff6409ed",
                                                "text": "The text recounts a 2011 experiment: Researchers tested 136 healthy young men’s testosterone levels, asked them about their political party affiliations, then gave them either a placebo or ten grams of AndroGel one percent, a high-end dose of a common form of testosterone often used in hormone replacement therapies. […] Alogaily and the paper’s co-authors argued that this is “evidence that neuro-active hormones affect political preferences”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69fc4455-285f-380f-9c64-51f806299793",
                                        "entry_id": "feb5c607-5c99-3495-a16d-39f0f9d1406d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A synthetic compound with the same activity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81d90d03-f26c-40fb-bed2-4a0e45b188a9",
                                                "sense_id": "69fc4455-285f-380f-9c64-51f806299793",
                                                "text": "Tumours of the adrenal cortex which secreted feminizing hormones […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a75cc3e-4815-4e86-b7de-f7e69ec95369",
                                                "sense_id": "69fc4455-285f-380f-9c64-51f806299793",
                                                "text": "Gender-affirming hormone therapy may involve testosterone for trans people assigned female at birth (AFAB) and estradiol and anti-androgens for trans people AMAB."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92fe8be1-00f3-3948-893e-c6ddb568ba0e",
                                        "entry_id": "feb5c607-5c99-3495-a16d-39f0f9d1406d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A synthetic compound with the same activity.",
                                            "Sex hormones, as used in hormone replacement therapy for transgender or intersex people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "plural-normally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ab45600-a4d7-4cb8-8448-18c95a9dfa8f",
                                                "sense_id": "92fe8be1-00f3-3948-893e-c6ddb568ba0e",
                                                "text": "I'm going to be going to slightly higher doses of hormones soon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "069d73db-bf9c-3e04-b028-7f9989786abe",
                                        "entry_id": "feb5c607-5c99-3495-a16d-39f0f9d1406d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any similar substance in plants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
